{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hello Anxiety</i> is the first chapter in an upcoming series of narrative puzzle RPGs that explore mental health through atmospheric storytelling and symbolic environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed in detailed pixel art with a focus on mood and meaning, <i>Hello Anxiety</i> invites players to reflect on their own minds while guiding a young character through theirs.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted pixel art environments, rich with atmosphere and emotional depth\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/04581d95ea22dd47b6d11befbcb0e378.poster.avif?t=1769092942\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/04581d95ea22dd47b6d11befbcb0e378.webm?t=1769092942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/04581d95ea22dd47b6d11befbcb0e378.mp4?t=1769092942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal puzzles woven into metaphorical spaces-nothing is just what it seems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/9bdd16ecf1c8010c98fbbbb3ade70635.poster.avif?t=1769092942\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/9bdd16ecf1c8010c98fbbbb3ade70635.webm?t=1769092942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/9bdd16ecf1c8010c98fbbbb3ade70635.mp4?t=1769092942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A h